# A class constructor creates the keys of its parent's constructor, of its fields, of the methods that it calls and its own, in their turn: that is an order of the layout. The declared order lists what Emitter's methods alone create first.
# RUN: plan orders mechanisms=all
# CHECK: order {{*}}: "id" "force" "mass" "end" "listeners"
# CHECK: order {{*}}: "context" "cache" "id" "count"
